From 92caef46eea022412d063cc953887403dfee85ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode <user@example.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:40:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 20/29] turnip/a5xx: WIP bindful textures and TPL1 state

- Lower sampler2D derefs to bindful TPL1 slots (Vulkan binding == slot)
  instead of bindless descriptors on chip 5.
- Emit TPL1 sampler state (4 dwords) and texture state (12 dwords) from
  the packed A6xx descriptors; the field layout overlaps A5xx TEX_CONST
  for the fields we need, and chip 5 images are linear.
- Program the full TPL1_MODE_CNTL value (bank bits + fd5 flags).

Status: texture sampling itself works - tu5_tex_fc_test samples a
red/green 64x64 texture correctly via gl_FragCoord. The varying-based
tu5_tex_test returns a constant (0,0) UV, and a later run hung the GPU;
a warm reboot did not recover it (needs a full power-off). VPC_VAR_DISABLE
now matches fd5 (computed before appending POS/PSIZ), but that fix is
untested. Debug output for FS inputs / VS outputs / linkage is included
under TU5_GFX_DEBUG.
